Package: clinRval
Title: Risk-Based Validation of R in Clinical Trials
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Shekhar Chalwadi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "skrchalwadicg@gmail.com")
Description: Supports risk-based validation of R environments, packages, and
    analysis programs used in clinical trials. Helps generate evidence
    suitable for regulatory submissions in the context of United States
    Food and Drug Administration (FDA) Title 21 of the Code of Federal
    Regulations (CFR) Part 11 and International Council for Harmonisation
    (ICH) Guideline E6 on Good Clinical Practice. Includes environment
    capture, basic accuracy checks, and report helpers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
